      if no channel is specified); 0 otherwise

  Module

      irc

  Example

      set halfopped [botishalfop "#lamest"]

------------------------------------------------------------------------

botisvoice [channel]

  Description

      Returns 1 if the bot has a voice on the specified channel (or any
      channel if no channel is specified); 0 otherwise.

  Returns

      1 if the bot has a voice on the specified channel (or any channel
      if no channel is specified); 0 otherwise

  Module

      irc

  Example

